Data Engineer

Job Title: Data Engineer
Experience: 2–5 Years
Employment Type: Full-Time

Job Description

We are looking for a Data Engineer to design, develop, and maintain scalable data pipelines and data platforms. The ideal candidate should have strong SQL and Python skills and experience working with data processing, ETL/ELT, databases, and cloud data platforms.

Responsibilities
Design and develop scalable ETL/ELT pipelines.
Build data ingestion and transformation workflows.
Process structured and unstructured data.
Design and maintain data warehouses and data lakes.
Develop efficient SQL queries and data models.
Ensure data quality, consistency, and reliability.
Implement data validation and monitoring processes.
Optimize data pipelines for performance and scalability.
Integrate data from APIs, databases, files, and external systems.
Collaborate with data scientists, AI engineers, backend engineers, and business teams.
Troubleshoot pipeline failures and data-quality issues.
Document data pipelines, schemas, and engineering processes.
Required Skills
Strong SQL skills.
Programming experience with Python, Java, or Scala.
Experience with ETL/ELT pipelines.
Knowledge of relational databases such as PostgreSQL/MySQL.
Experience with data warehousing concepts.
Understanding of data modeling and database design.
Experience with Apache Spark or similar distributed processing frameworks.
Knowledge of cloud platforms such as AWS, Azure, or GCP.
Experience with Git and version control.
Understanding of data quality and pipeline monitoring.
